Package: nof1kit
Title: Design, Monitor, and Analyze Single-Case (N-of-1) Intensive
    Longitudinal Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Miura", "Meng", email = "haomeng797@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-1522-1997"))
Description: Tools for the full lifecycle of a single-case (N-of-1)
    experimental study: generating preregistrable randomization schedules
    under run-length constraints, exporting them for mobile data collection,
    validating incoming ecological momentary assessment (EMA) records, and
    monitoring compliance. Designed around the workflow of Meng (under
    review), a 70-day randomized N-of-1 study collected with stock iOS
    tools at 92.9% compliance.
